{'symbol': 'LYB', 'date': '2019-11-02 08:30:00', 'title': 'LyondellBasell Reports Third-Quarter 2019 Earnings', 'text': 'LYONDELLBASELL REPORTS THIRD QUARTER 2019 EARNINGS.Q3 EARNINGS PER SHARE $2.85.Q3 EARNINGS PER SHARE ESTIMATE $2.76 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.QUARTER INCLUDED $85 MILLION NON-CASH TAX SETTLEMENT THAT INCREASED EARNINGS BY $0.25 PER SHARE.SAYS PROFITABILITY AT HOUSTON REFINERY SHOULD BEGIN TO IMPROVE DURING Q4.QTRLY SALES AND OTHER OPERATING REVENUES $8,722 MILLION VERSUS $10,155 MILLION."WE EXPECT TO SEE TYPICAL SEASONAL SOFTENING OF DEMAND IN THE FINAL MONTHS OF THE YEAR".Q3 REVENUE VIEW $9.07 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.'}
